 7. 📊 Young voters shift to Dems 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Chart: Rachel Buigas-Lopez/The New York Times 70% of young voters identified as Democrats or leaned that way — a 15-point jump from just two years ago, a New York Times/Siena poll found. 

 53% said they fear the U.S. is in danger of failing as a nation, up from 38% two years ago. NYT gift link . 

 
 
