 8. 🎤 1 fun thing: Hov&#x27;s halftime show 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 Image: NFL

 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Jay-Z — one of the music industry's most powerful performers — will headline the Super Bowl halftime show at SoFi Stadium in Los Angeles next February.

 The rapper's entertainment company, Roc Nation, helps produce the halftime show — meaning he effectively picked himself to perform. NFL Commissioner Roger Goodell said he had one request when the league first reached an agreement with Roc Nation in 2019: "That Jay-Z take the stage himself one day, whenever the moment felt right to him." Go deeper ... Watch the announcement video . 

 
 
